# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make the most out of this course, we recommend familiarity with basic "
"linear algebra, complex numbers, and elementary mathematical notions "
"including sets and functions. The following sources are a few among many "
"that cover this material:\n"
msgstr ""
"Aby jak najlepiej skorzystać z tego kursu, zalecamy znajomość podstawowej "
"algebry liniowej, liczb zespolonych i elementarnych pojęć matematycznych, w "
"tym zbiorów i funkcji. Poniższe źródła to kilka z wielu, które obejmują ten "
"materiał:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Khan Academy: Linear algebra](https://www.khanacademy.org/math/linear-"
"algebra)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Khan Academy: Algebra liniowa](https://www.khanacademy.org/math/linear-"
"algebra)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   In this video series, Sal Khan introduces key concepts in linear algebra "
"that we will rely upon.\n"
msgstr ""
"   W tej serii filmów Sal Khan wprowadza kluczowe pojęcia z algebry "
"liniowej, na których będziemy polegać.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stephen Friedberg, Arnold Insel, and Lawrence Spence. [Linear "
"Algebra](https://www.pearson.com/en-us/subject-catalog/p/linear-"
"algebra/P200000006185/9780137515424)\n"
msgstr ""
"Stephen Friedberg, Arnold Insel i Lawrence Spence. [Linear "
"Algebra](https://www.pearson.com/en-us/subject-catalog/p/linear-"
"algebra/P200000006185/9780137515424)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This book on linear algebra covers the material we require, and also "
"includes appendices on sets, functions, and complex numbers.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Ta książka o algebrze liniowej obejmuje wymagany materiał i zawiera "
"dodatki dotyczące zbiorów, funkcji i liczb zespolonych.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sheldon Axler. [Linear Algebra Done "
"Right](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-11080-6)\n"
msgstr ""
"Sheldon Axler. [Linear Algebra Done "
"Right](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-11080-6)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
