msgstr ""
"Ricky Shadrach i Rod Pierce. [Introduction to "
"Sets](https://www.mathsisfun.com/sets/sets-introduction.html)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
